  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0.010520000000042273,
      "end": 3.1915200000000254,
      "text": "The judgment I reached at Amazon still matters to"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.3075200000000677,
      "end": 3.6675200000000245,
      "text": "me."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.248520000000042,
      "end": 7.220520000000022,
      "text": "A role can be provided by an organization."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.125520000000051,
      "end": 11.991520000000037,
      "text": "My abilities need an ongoing connection to real needs."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.653520000000015,
      "end": 17.137520000000052,
      "text": "Each project is a chance to strengthen that connection:"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.798520000000053,
      "end": 19.923520000000053,
      "text": "understand a customer more deeply,"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.527520000000038,
      "end": 22.44252000000006,
      "text": "make a better product choice,"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.13952000000006,
      "end": 25.798520000000053,
      "text": "and learn what it takes for someone to adopt"
    },
    {
      "start": 25.832520000000045,
      "end": 27.38838800000002,
      "text": "the result."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.38838800000002,
      "end": 29.98938800000002,
      "text": "If AI can handle much more work in five"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.058388000000036,
      "end": 31.44038800000004,
      "text": "or ten years,"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.125388000000044,
      "end": 34.795388,
      "text": "I want to understand more about what people need"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.87638800000002,
      "end": 35.57338800000002,
      "text": "by then."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.67638800000003,
      "end": 40.21738800000003,
      "text": "That growth can begin with the next conversation and"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.252387999999996,
      "end": 41.52938800000004,
      "text": "the next project."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.320387999999994,
      "end": 47.19838800000004,
      "text": "Stronger tools make me optimistic about what engineers can"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.25638800000003,
      "end": 47.94138800000003,
      "text": "attempt."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.75438800000002,
      "end": 51.261388000000025,
      "text": "I want to use that opportunity to make things"
    },
    {
      "start": 51.33138800000002,
      "end": 54.55938800000003,
      "text": "I care about that someone else actually needs."
    }
  ]
